  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa SOIL: Soil Organic matter Improves Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research grant aims to embed maize varieties best adapted to releasing and taking up nitrogen from soil organic matter into the practice of conservation agriculture in Zimbabwe and Malawi improving soil condition. It benefits smallholder farmers, agricultural researchers, NGOs and seed companies. SDGs 2, 13, 15.</narrative>
  </description>
